                                                "sense_id": "3f2642da-e4fe-39a4-af1e-8fbd7b801664",
                                                "text": "On an attractive console with two winged putti as supporters [...] is a marriage coat of arms : Dexter, the Paoli arms : Gules (base), a bend azure charged with five lilies gules, and or (chief); Sinister, the[…]"
